An OAuth 2 [session](/docs/references/cloud/models/session) will have the following columns.

| Property | Description |
| -------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| provider | The OAuth2 Provider. |
| providerUid | User ID from the OAuth 2 Provider. |
