Both fields are optional:

| Field | Default | Purpose |
| ---------- | ------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `branchId` | auto-generated | Custom ID (`a-z`, `A-Z`, `0-9`, `.`, `-`, `_`, max 36 chars) |
