Create a new table with the following columns:
| Field | Type | Required | Size |
|-------------|--------|----------|----------|
| userId | Varchar | Yes | 200 |
| title | Varchar | Yes | 200 |
| description | Text | No | - |

Change the table's permissions in the settings to give access.

